{"body":{"history":[{"content":"Habari! I'm your AI business coach. I can help you in English or Kiswahili. How can I assist your business today?","role":"assistant"},{"content":"nikona aina gani ya bidhaa?","role":"user"},{"content":"**Anime za bidhaa zako (Business ID: 255)**  \n\n• **Mangoes (Kent)** – KES 60 (Stoc 150) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n• **Avocados (Hass)** – KES 50 (Stoc 100) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n• **Apples (Pink Lady)** – KES 80 (Stoc 200) – **Profit KES 40** per unit  \n• **Bananas (Sweet)** – KES 25 (Stoc 5) ⚠️ **LOW STOCK** – **Profit KES 15** per unit  \n• **Pineapples** – KES 150 (Stoc 40) – **Profit KES 70** per unit  \n• **Oranges (Valencia)** – KES 55 (Stoc 120) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n\nJumla: **6 aina ya bidhaa** zilizo katika stok.  \nKuna **mmoja tu** (Bidhaa ya Bananas) ambayo imekuwa low stock; unaweza kuzidisha stock kulingana na hali.  \n\nNini unahitaji zaidi? 🚀","role":"assistant"}],"language":"sw","message":"niambie kuhusu mananasi zangu?"},"level":"info","message":"Request: POST /api/chatbot/chat","params":{},"query":{},"timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:19:44.935Z"}
{"body":{"history":[{"content":"Habari! I'm your AI business coach. I can help you in English or Kiswahili. How can I assist your business today?","role":"assistant"},{"content":"nikona aina gani ya bidhaa?","role":"user"},{"content":"**Anime za bidhaa zako (Business ID: 255)**  \n\n• **Mangoes (Kent)** – KES 60 (Stoc 150) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n• **Avocados (Hass)** – KES 50 (Stoc 100) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n• **Apples (Pink Lady)** – KES 80 (Stoc 200) – **Profit KES 40** per unit  \n• **Bananas (Sweet)** – KES 25 (Stoc 5) ⚠️ **LOW STOCK** – **Profit KES 15** per unit  \n• **Pineapples** – KES 150 (Stoc 40) – **Profit KES 70** per unit  \n• **Oranges (Valencia)** – KES 55 (Stoc 120) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n\nJumla: **6 aina ya bidhaa** zilizo katika stok.  \nKuna **mmoja tu** (Bidhaa ya Bananas) ambayo imekuwa low stock; unaweza kuzidisha stock kulingana na hali.  \n\nNini unahitaji zaidi? 🚀","role":"assistant"},{"content":"niambie kuhusu mananasi zangu?","role":"user"},{"content":"**Manana za Biashara yako (KIDO: 255)**  \n\n- **Mmanufaa (Revenue):** KES 1 529 820  \n- **Vifedha (Expenses):** KES 180 000  \n- **Manifa (Profit):** KES 1 349 820  \n\n**Ufunguzi wa Manina**  \n\\[\n\\text{Manina (\\%)} = \\frac{\\text{Manifa}}{\\text{Mmanufaa}} \\times 100\n                     = \\frac{1 349 820}{1 529 820} \\times 100\n                     \\approx 88.3\\%\n\\]\n\n**Hii inaashiria:** Kwa kila shilingi inayotumika, una **manina ya takriban 88 %**. Hii ina maana kwamba kiasi kikubwa cha mmanufaa kinachopita katika mapambo, wakati wa vifedha vinachokua kiasi ndogo tu.\n\n**Mfano wa Kufanya Mawasiliano:**  \n- **Mmanufaa ya Kila Siku:** KES 1 529 820 ÷ 30 siku ≈ **KES 51 000** kwa siku.  \n- **Vifedha za Kila Siku:** KES 180 000 ÷ 30 siku = **KES 6 000**.  \n- **Manina ya Kila Siku:** 88.3 % (haina ubadilisho wa muda).\n\n**Mpango wa Kukuza Manina zaidi**  \n1. **Zingatia biashara bora zaidi** – Tazama aina zinazofanya mwananchi kupata maudhui (k.m. “Avocados” na “Pineapples”) ambazo hupatia manina ya 70 %+; ongeza uchunguzi wa uzalishaji.  \n2. **Punguza vifedha vingine vya ziada** – Tazama vifedha vingine (k.m. malipo ya usafiri, dawa ya biashara) ambazo zinaweza kupunguza bila kuathiri usimamizi wa kina.  \n3. **Kuboresha usambazaji** – Hakikisha aina zilizo na **stock** ya hali ya hali (kwa mfano, “Bananas” imekuwa low stock) zinapokubalika, ili kuepuka matumizi ya ziada za uzalishaji.\n\nJe, unahitaji maelezo zaidi juu ya aina maalum ya bidhaa au mbinu za kuhakikisha uzalishaji unaongeza manina? 🚀","role":"assistant"}],"language":"sw","message":"niambie kuhusu mananasi zangu?"},"level":"info","message":"Request: POST /api/chatbot/chat","params":{},"query":{},"timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:21:21.152Z"}
{"body":{"history":[{"content":"Habari! I'm your AI business coach. I can help you in English or Kiswahili. How can I assist your business today?","role":"assistant"},{"content":"nikona aina gani ya bidhaa?","role":"user"},{"content":"**Anime za bidhaa zako (Business ID: 255)**  \n\n• **Mangoes (Kent)** – KES 60 (Stoc 150) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n• **Avocados (Hass)** – KES 50 (Stoc 100) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n• **Apples (Pink Lady)** – KES 80 (Stoc 200) – **Profit KES 40** per unit  \n• **Bananas (Sweet)** – KES 25 (Stoc 5) ⚠️ **LOW STOCK** – **Profit KES 15** per unit  \n• **Pineapples** – KES 150 (Stoc 40) – **Profit KES 70** per unit  \n• **Oranges (Valencia)** – KES 55 (Stoc 120) – **Profit KES 30** per unit  \n\nJumla: **6 aina ya bidhaa** zilizo katika stok.  \nKuna **mmoja tu** (Bidhaa ya Bananas) ambayo imekuwa low stock; unaweza kuzidisha stock kulingana na hali.  \n\nNini unahitaji zaidi? 🚀","role":"assistant"},{"content":"niambie kuhusu mananasi zangu?","role":"user"},{"content":"**Manana za Biashara yako (KIDO: 255)**  \n\n- **Mmanufaa (Revenue):** KES 1 529 820  \n- **Vifedha (Expenses):** KES 180 000  \n- **Manifa (Profit):** KES 1 349 820  \n\n**Ufunguzi wa Manina**  \n\\[\n\\text{Manina (\\%)} = \\frac{\\text{Manifa}}{\\text{Mmanufaa}} \\times 100\n                     = \\frac{1 349 820}{1 529 820} \\times 100\n                     \\approx 88.3\\%\n\\]\n\n**Hii inaashiria:** Kwa kila shilingi inayotumika, una **manina ya takriban 88 %**. Hii ina maana kwamba kiasi kikubwa cha mmanufaa kinachopita katika mapambo, wakati wa vifedha vinachokua kiasi ndogo tu.\n\n**Mfano wa Kufanya Mawasiliano:**  \n- **Mmanufaa ya Kila Siku:** KES 1 529 820 ÷ 30 siku ≈ **KES 51 000** kwa siku.  \n- **Vifedha za Kila Siku:** KES 180 000 ÷ 30 siku = **KES 6 000**.  \n- **Manina ya Kila Siku:** 88.3 % (haina ubadilisho wa muda).\n\n**Mpango wa Kukuza Manina zaidi**  \n1. **Zingatia biashara bora zaidi** – Tazama aina zinazofanya mwananchi kupata maudhui (k.m. “Avocados” na “Pineapples”) ambazo hupatia manina ya 70 %+; ongeza uchunguzi wa uzalishaji.  \n2. **Punguza vifedha vingine vya ziada** – Tazama vifedha vingine (k.m. malipo ya usafiri, dawa ya biashara) ambazo zinaweza kupunguza bila kuathiri usimamizi wa kina.  \n3. **Kuboresha usambazaji** – Hakikisha aina zilizo na **stock** ya hali ya hali (kwa mfano, “Bananas” imekuwa low stock) zinapokubalika, ili kuepuka matumizi ya ziada za uzalishaji.\n\nJe, unahitaji maelezo zaidi juu ya aina maalum ya bidhaa au mbinu za kuhakikisha uzalishaji unaongeza manina? 🚀","role":"assistant"},{"content":"niambie kuhusu mananasi zangu?","role":"user"},{"content":"**Manana za Biashara Yako (KIDO: 255)**  \n\n- **Mmanufaa (Revenue)**: **KES 1 529 820**  \n- **Vifedha (Expenses)**: **KES 180 000**  \n- **Manifa (Profit)**: **KES 1 349 820**  \n\n**Jinsi ya kufanya hesabu ya manina**  \n\\[\n\\text{Manina (\\%)} = \\frac{\\text{Manifa}}{\\text{Mmanufaa}} \\times 100\n                    = \\frac{1 349 820}{1 529 820} \\times 100\n                    \\approx 88.3\\%\n\\]\n\n**Maana ya hatua hiyo**  \n- Kila **shillingi** iliyopatikana katika mmanufaa, **88 cents** yanapofika katika mapambo baada ya kufuta vifedha.  \n- Hii inaashiria **viwango vya viwango vya viwango** vya ubora; unaongeza **profit** kwa kuongeza mmanufaa au kupunguza vifedha.\n\n---\n\n### Mapendekezo ya Kukuza Manina zaidi\n1. **Ongeza aina zinazopata mmanufaa kubwa**  \n   - Bidhaa kama **Pineapples** (profit KES 70 kwa unit) na **Avocados** (profit KES 30 kwa unit) hupunguza ununuzi wa mmanufaa.  \n   - Hakikisha uzalishaji wa bidhaa hizi unapokuwa **stock** ya hali (kwa mfano, “Bananas” imekuwa low stock – 5 vipande).\n\n2. **Punguza vifedha vya ziada**  \n   - Tingiza **vifedha vingine** (k.m. malipo ya usafiri, dawa ya uzalishaji) ambazo zinaweza kupunguza bila kuathiri usambazaji wa bidhaa.  \n   - Fanya **budget** ya kila mwezi unaotokana na mmanufaa halisi.\n\n3. **Usimamizi wa uzalishaji**  \n   - Hakikisha **stock** ya bidhaa zenye **profit** ya juu haijachukua **stock** ya **low** (kwa mfano, “Bananas” 5 vipande).  \n   - Hakikisha uzalishaji wa bidhaa zenye **margin** ya **>70 %** ni wa kiasi kibichi ili kuepuka matumizi ya ziada.\n\n4. **Jukumu la usimamizi wa muda**  \n   - **Mmanufaa ya kila siku**: 1 529 820 ÷ 30 siku ≈ **KES 51 000**.  \n   - **Vifedha ya kila siku**: 180 000 ÷ 30 siku = **KES 6 000**.  \n   - **Manina ya kila siku**: 88.3 % (haina ubadilisho wa muda).  \n\n---\n\n**Hatimaye**:  \n- **Manina ya 88 %** inaashiria unanipa **ubora wa biashara** wa hali ya hali.  \n- Kwa kuzingatia **bidhaa zenye profit ya juu** na **kukodisha/vifedha vya ziada**, unaweza **kuongeza manina** hadi **>90 %** katika mwezi ujao.\n\nJe, unahitaji maelezo zaidi juu ya aina maalum ya bidhaa ambayo unahitaji kuongeza, au mbinu za kufuatilia **stock** ya “Bananas” ili kuepuka **low stock**? 🚀","role":"assistant"}],"language":"sw","message":"niambie kuhusu pineapples zangu?"},"level":"info","message":"Request: POST /api/chatbot/chat","params":{},"query":{},"timestamp":"2026-03-28T07:21:46.196Z"}
